WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.645
This mini project brings the main Module 1 ideas
together We start with sales

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:11.697
costs and a tax rate Then we calculate profit tax
net profit and a margin

00:00:11.882 --> 00:00:17.529
and finally we format the results so they are easy
to read Run the program

00:00:17.555 --> 00:00:22.755
once with the starting values Then change the sales
and costs to create at least

00:00:22.768 --> 00:00:28.334
two different scenarios For example try a strong
profit scenario and then a much

00:00:28.347 --> 00:00:33.901
smaller profit scenario As you work trace the
calculation

00:00:33.927 --> 00:00:38.811
from the raw inputs to the final output This is a
small program but it

00:00:38.824 --> 00:00:44.416
represents a complete analytical workflow define the
data transform the data and communicate

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:45.087
the result
